TIKI
// HZM coop - DISMEMBERMENT PHASE 0 (decapitation): the flying SEVERED HEAD physics model spawned by the
// engine (game.dll Sentient::CoopGoreTryDecapitate) at the corpse's "Bip01 Head" tag when an AI dies to an
// explosion. Thrown as a HeadGibObject (object.cpp), a MOVETYPE_TOSS clone of the proven helmet-pop
// HelmetObject, so it tumbles + settles + replicates to every coop client exactly like a popped helmet.
//
// Mesh = the STOCK generic soldier head skeleton (models/human/heads/head1.skd, 7 Bip01 bones incl.
// "Bip01 Head"), the same skelmodel the body TIKs $include - so its face UVs match the "hans" face skin
// (scripts/faces.shader, ships). scale 0.52 matches the in-world head size (character bodies render at
// 0.52 - gear/heads are authored in cm). The idle borrows a stock Bip01 body idle (atease.skc); only the
// head/neck channels apply to this head-only skeleton, the rest are ignored - the HeadGibObject's own
// avelocity does the tumbling, so the internal pose is cosmetic.
//
// BETTER ART (future): a purpose-built head mesh with a bloody neck cross-section surface (so the cut end
// reads red) instead of the intact face; for MVP the gore is sold by the neck-stump cap + blood spurt the
// engine attaches to the CORPSE, plus the head flying at speed. See _research/limb_dismemberment_plan.md.
setup
{
	scale 0.52
	path models/human/heads
	skelmodel head1.skd
	surface head shader hans
}

init
{
	server
	{
		classname Animate
		setsize "-4 -4 -4" "4 4 4"
	}
}

animations
{
	idle models/human/animation/idle/atease.skc
}
